From: mocha device tree
Subject: [PATCH] wifi-hal: fix use-after-free in the cleanup command loop

Three fixes for the legacy wifi HAL crash on stop (vtable recycled to
0x72646e61 "andr", CFI check faults in wifi_cleanup):

1. wifi_get_cancel_cmd() used wifi_get_cmd() (lookup only) and then
   releaseRef() deleted the command without removing it from info->cmd,
   leaving a dangling pointer. Use wifi_unregister_cmd() so the command
   is gone from the array before it is freed, matching wifi_cancel_cmd().

2. wifi_stop_hal() created a throwaway HalInit and cancel()ed it. Its
   cancel unregisters by id, but preInit and start_hal both register a
   HalInit with the same id (HAL_START_REQUEST_ID), so the throwaway
   command's cancel removed the wrong entry. The LOGGER_HAL_STOP side
   effect is already sent by the real HalInit::cancel() in the cleanup
   loop below, so just return success.

3. In the cleanup loop, cancel() can fail or return early without
   unregistering, so the unconditional releaseRef() used to delete a
   command that was still in info->cmd. Remove it explicitly before
   releaseRef(), and keep clean_up set after the loop so the event loop
   thread never frees hal_info while the loop dereferences info->cmd.

diff --git a/bcmdhd/wifi_hal/common.cpp b/bcmdhd/wifi_hal/common.cpp
index 7f164ab..bc3697b 100644
--- a/bcmdhd/wifi_hal/common.cpp
+++ b/bcmdhd/wifi_hal/common.cpp
@@ -289,7 +289,14 @@ wifi_error wifi_cancel_cmd(wifi_request_id id, wifi_interface_handle iface)
 wifi_error wifi_get_cancel_cmd(wifi_request_id id, wifi_interface_handle iface)
 {
     wifi_handle handle = getWifiHandle(iface);
-    WifiCommand *cmd = wifi_get_cmd(handle, id);
+    /* 【修复 2026-11-17】原实现用 wifi_get_cmd()（只查不改）拿到命令后直接
+     * releaseRef() delete，却没有把它从 info->cmd 数组移除 —— 数组里就留下
+     * 一个悬空指针。下次 wifi_cleanup 遍历数组时，对已 delete 的命令调
+     * cancel()/releaseRef() 虚函数，vtable 已被复用成垃圾（0x72646e61
+     * "andr"），CFI 检查踩空页 SIGSEGV，导致 wifi HAL 崩溃重启、开机动画
+     * 重放。改用 wifi_unregister_cmd()（从数组移除并返回），保证 delete 前
+     * 命令一定不在数组里，与 wifi_cancel_cmd() 的行为保持一致。 */
+    WifiCommand *cmd = wifi_unregister_cmd(handle, id);
     ALOGV("Get Cancel WifiCommand = %p", cmd);
     if (cmd) {
         cmd->cancel();
diff --git a/bcmdhd/wifi_hal/wifi_hal.cpp b/bcmdhd/wifi_hal/wifi_hal.cpp
index af9b06c..8d0d3a4 100644
--- a/bcmdhd/wifi_hal/wifi_hal.cpp
+++ b/bcmdhd/wifi_hal/wifi_hal.cpp
@@ -710,13 +710,32 @@ void wifi_cleanup(wifi_handle handle, wifi_cleaned_up_handler cleaned_up_handler
             ALOGI("Cancelling command %p:%s", cmd, cmd->getType());
             pthread_mutex_unlock(&info->cb_lock);
             cmd->cancel();
-            if (num_cmd == info->num_cmd) {
-                ALOGI("Cancelling command %p:%s did not work", cmd, (cmd ? cmd->getType(): ""));
-                bad_commands++;
+            pthread_mutex_lock(&info->cb_lock);
+            /* 【修复 2026-11-17】cancel() 可能失败或提前返回（例如
+             * HalInit::cancel 在 LOGGER_HAL_STOP 命令 create/发送失败时
+             * 直接 return，不执行末尾的 wifi_unregister_cmd），导致命令
+             * 仍留在 info->cmd 数组里。原代码此时只 bad_commands++ 跳过，
+             * 但紧接着 releaseRef() 无条件 delete 了命令对象 —— 数组里
+             * 就留下一个悬空指针。下一次访问（或再次 cleanup）时 vtable
+             * 已被复用成垃圾（0x72646e61 "andr"），CFI 检查踩空页崩溃。
+             *
+             * 修复：cancel 之后若命令仍在原位置（cancel 没有通过
+             * unregister 把它移走），这里显式 memmove 移除它，保证
+             * releaseRef(delete) 之前命令一定不在数组里。 */
+            if (info->num_cmd > bad_commands &&
+                    info->cmd[bad_commands].cmd == cmd) {
+                memmove(&info->cmd[bad_commands],
+                        &info->cmd[bad_commands + 1],
+                        (info->num_cmd - bad_commands - 1) * sizeof(cmd_info));
+                info->num_cmd--;
             }
             /* release reference added when command is saved */
+            pthread_mutex_unlock(&info->cb_lock);
             cmd->releaseRef();
             pthread_mutex_lock(&info->cb_lock);
+        } else {
+            /* 空条目防御：跳过，避免死循环 */
+            bad_commands++;
         }
     }
 
@@ -731,6 +750,13 @@ void wifi_cleanup(wifi_handle handle, wifi_cleaned_up_handler cleaned_up_handler
     }
     pthread_mutex_unlock(&info->cb_lock);
 
+    /* 【修复 2026-11-17】clean_up 必须放在 while 循环之后（cb_lock 解锁后）。
+     * 若提前置位，event loop 线程在 while 循环期间一旦收到 nl80211 事件
+     * 就会退出 poll 循环并执行 internal_cleaned_up_handler()，把接口和
+     * hal_info free 掉，而这里的 while 循环还在解引用 info->cmd → use-after-free
+     * （实测崩溃：cleanup cmd id=0，vtable 被复写成 0x72646e61 "andr"）。
+     * 放在这里后，event loop 在 while 循环完成前一直阻塞在 poll 上，直到
+     * 下面 write(cleanup_socks[0]) 才退出，顺序安全。 */
     info->clean_up = true;
 
     /* global func ptr be invalidated and will not call any command from legacy hal */
diff --git a/bcmdhd/wifi_hal/wifi_logger.cpp b/bcmdhd/wifi_hal/wifi_logger.cpp
index 694df19..c584cf0 100644
--- a/bcmdhd/wifi_hal/wifi_logger.cpp
+++ b/bcmdhd/wifi_hal/wifi_logger.cpp
@@ -2058,10 +2058,18 @@ wifi_error wifi_stop_ring_dump(wifi_interface_handle iface)
 
 wifi_error wifi_stop_hal(wifi_interface_handle iface)
 {
-    HalInit *cmd = new HalInit(iface, HAL_START_REQUEST_ID);
-    NULL_CHECK_RETURN(cmd, "memory allocation failure", WIFI_ERROR_OUT_OF_MEMORY);
-    cmd->cancel();
-    cmd->releaseRef();
+    /* 【修复 2026-11-17】原实现 new 一个临时 HalInit 再 cancel()，有两个问题：
+     * 1) wifi_hal_preInit() 和 wifi_start_hal() 都注册了 id=HAL_START_REQUEST_ID
+     *    的 HalInit，数组里有两个同 id 的命令。而 HalInit::cancel() 末尾按 id
+     *    调 wifi_unregister_cmd()，只会移除第一个匹配项 —— 临时命令的 cancel
+     *    会把数组里第一个 HalInit 移走（且不 delete，泄漏），破坏数组状态。
+     * 2) new HalInit(iface) 会在构造函数里解引用 iface（wlan0Handle），cleanup
+     *    阶段该 handle 可能已悬空，读到垃圾内存。
+     *
+     * cancel() 的实质副作用（发送 LOGGER_HAL_STOP 给驱动）会在下面
+     * wifi_cleanup 的 while 循环里、由数组里真正的 HalInit::cancel() 完成，
+     * 所以这里直接返回成功即可，无需（也不应）再造临时命令。 */
+    (void)iface;
     return WIFI_SUCCESS;
 }
 
